This repository does not include the COmanage Registry source; registry/slashRoot/.../000-comanage.conf is adapted
from the virtual host that upstream's container entrypoint generates. The repository's workflow builds the upstream
COmanage Registry 5.2.0 release (Apache-2.0) with the release's own container/build.sh, unmodified, and publishes
the result as an unofficial build at ghcr.io/graemevarga/comanage-registry. That image, like any image built from
the release, includes the official Docker "php" image (PHP License) on Debian bookworm with its packages under their
own licenses, PHP extensions including PECL redis, and the Oracle Instant Client 21.14 (Oracle Free Use Terms and
Conditions), which the release's Dockerfile downloads. The workshop also runs the official PostgreSQL (PostgreSQL
License) and Mailpit (MIT) images. Upstream's NOTICE is reproduced below.

The sample FileSource population in filesource/ (fictional people) is converted from
the COmanage Registry v4 training materials by Shayna Atkinson
(https://github.internet2.edu/satkinson/comanage-registry-training-ansible).

